<title>MEXICO: Desc 6-month net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Desc 6-month net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mos 1997		    6-mos 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Net		  956.33 million	     1.426 bln</p>
<p>     Revs		 7.131 bln		6.501 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     1.935 bln		1.894 bln</p>
<p>     Oper profit	1.120 bln		1.074 bln</p>
<p>     Integ fin gain   123.28 million	     682.54 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid    294.04 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>	    FX loss     74.83 million		n.a.</p>
<p>	    Int earned  153.01 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>	    Mon gain    339.13 million	     n.a.</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>Full company name is Desc SA.</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565))</p>
